  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation of the sanitation system in Beira</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Based on the feasibility study, the project aims to improve the living conditions of the Beira inhabitants, reducing health risks and contributing to the protection of the environment. The main objective of the project is to make the sanitation system of Beira City more resilient, through:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Rehabilitate the sanitation infrastructures: wastewater collection, sewer networks, pumping stations and treatment plant;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Strengthen the operational capacities of SASB and the coordination capacities between SASB and AIAS.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
